## 2. Auto-Correction Pipeline — ✅ FULLY INTACT (Post-Session 6 Consolidation)

All scoring now routes through a single `autoMarking.service.ts` engine:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A["Student submits answer"] --> B
  B["useTestSubmission.ts\nmarkTestWithAnswers()"] --> C
  C["scoreQuestion(question as any, String(answer))\n→ autoMarking.service.ts"] --> D
  D{Question Type}
  D -->|"MCQ/True-False"| E["isAnswerCorrect()\n+ extractOptionPrefix()\nOption label resolution"]
  D -->|"Completion/Short-Answer"| F["isAnswerCorrect()\nChecks question.acceptableAnswers\n(pre-compiled pipe variants)"]
  D -->|"Matching Headings"| G["scoreMatching()\nString fallback path\n+ isAnswerCorrect()"]
  E & F & G --> H["Results aggregated\nquestionResults[q.number] = isCorrect"]
```

**3 scoring paths previously diverged — now unified under `scoreQuestion()`.**

