## 4. Known Limitation

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Tests **published before Session 5 fixes** (before word limit extraction was integrated into `classifyQuestion()`) will still have `wordLimit: undefined` in Firebase for completion questions. These tests must be **re-published** to get correct word limits.
>
> Tests published **after Session 5** will correctly enforce word limits.

